### `EtFormCheckbox`

Wraps `EtCheckbox` for boolean fields.

**Sub-components:**

| Sub-component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `EtFormCheckbox` (root) | Calls `useController`, provides context |
| `EtFormCheckbox.Control` | Renders `EtCheckbox` bound to context value/onChange |
| `EtFormCheckbox.Label` | Re-export of `EtCheckbox.Label` |
| `EtFormCheckbox.ErrorMessage` | Inline error text |

**Usage:**

```tsx
<EtFormCheckbox
  name="terms"
  control={control}
  rules={{ validate: (v) => Boolean(v) || 'You must accept the terms' }}
>
  <EtFormCheckbox.Control>
    <EtFormCheckbox.Label>I accept the terms</EtFormCheckbox.Label>
  </EtFormCheckbox.Control>
  <EtFormCheckbox.ErrorMessage />
</EtFormCheckbox>
```

**With custom `onChange` side-effect:**

```tsx
<EtFormCheckbox.Control onChange={(checked) => track('terms_toggled', { checked })}>
  <EtFormCheckbox.Label>I accept the terms</EtFormCheckbox.Label>
</EtFormCheckbox.Control>
```

