### `EtFormRadioGroup`

Wraps `EtRadioGroup` for single-selection string fields.

**Sub-components:**

| Sub-component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `EtFormRadioGroup` (root) | Calls `useController`, provides context |
| `EtFormRadioGroup.Control` | Renders `EtRadioGroup` bound to context |
| `EtFormRadioGroup.Option` | Re-export of `EtRadioGroup.Option` |
| `EtFormRadioGroup.ErrorMessage` | Inline error text |

**Usage:**

```tsx
<EtFormRadioGroup
  name="gender"
  control={control}
  rules={{ required: 'Select an option' }}
>
  <EtFormRadioGroup.Control>
    <EtFormRadioGroup.Option value="male">Male</EtFormRadioGroup.Option>
    <EtFormRadioGroup.Option value="female">Female</EtFormRadioGroup.Option>
  </EtFormRadioGroup.Control>
  <EtFormRadioGroup.ErrorMessage />
</EtFormRadioGroup>
```

