### `EtFormRadio`

Wraps `RadioIndicator` for boolean radio fields (display-only indicator).

**Sub-components:**

| Sub-component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `EtFormRadio` (root) | Calls `useController`, provides context |
| `EtFormRadio.Control` | Renders `RadioIndicator` bound to context (display-only) |
| `EtFormRadio.ErrorMessage` | Inline error text |

**Usage:**

```tsx
<EtFormRadio
  name="selected"
  control={control}
  rules={{ validate: (v) => Boolean(v) || 'Must be selected' }}
>
  <EtFormRadio.Control disabled={false} />
  <EtFormRadio.ErrorMessage />
</EtFormRadio>
```

**Note:** `EtFormRadio` renders a display-only indicator. Wire row-level selection separately (e.g., parent `Pressable`).

