### `EtFormChip`

Wraps `EtChip` for boolean chip selection fields.

**Sub-components:**

| Sub-component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `EtFormChip` (root) | Calls `useController`, provides context |
| `EtFormChip.Control` | Renders `EtChip` bound to context selected/onChange |
| `EtFormChip.Label` | Re-export of `EtChip.Label` |
| `EtFormChip.Icon` | Re-export of `EtChip.Icon` |
| `EtFormChip.ErrorMessage` | Inline error text |

**Usage:**

```tsx
<EtFormChip
  name="premium"
  control={control}
  rules={{ validate: v => v || 'Must select premium' }}
>
  <EtFormChip.Control>
    <EtFormChip.Icon name="star" />
    <EtFormChip.Label>Premium</EtFormChip.Label>
  </EtFormChip.Control>
  <EtFormChip.ErrorMessage />
</EtFormChip>
```

**With custom `onSelectionChange` side-effect:**

```tsx
<EtFormChip.Control onSelectionChange={(selected) => track('chip_toggled', { selected })}>
  <EtFormChip.Label>Premium</EtFormChip.Label>
</EtFormChip.Control>
```

