### `EtFormToggleSwitch`

Wraps `EtToggleSwitch` for boolean on/off fields.

**Sub-components:**

| Sub-component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `EtFormToggleSwitch` (root) | Calls `useController`, provides context |
| `EtFormToggleSwitch.Control` | Renders `EtToggleSwitch` bound to context value/onChange |
| `EtFormToggleSwitch.ErrorMessage` | Inline error text |

**Usage:**

```tsx
<EtFormToggleSwitch
  name="notifications"
  control={control}
>
  <EtFormToggleSwitch.Control size="small" haptics={true} />
  <EtFormToggleSwitch.ErrorMessage />
</EtFormToggleSwitch>
```

**With custom `onValueChange` side-effect:**

```tsx
<EtFormToggleSwitch.Control
  onValueChange={(value) => console.log('toggled', value)}
  size="small"
/>
```

