### `EtFormChipGroup`

Wraps `EtChipsGroupV2` for multi-select chip groups (manages `string[]` field).

**Sub-components:**

| Sub-component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `EtFormChipGroup` (root) | Calls `useController`, provides context |
| `EtFormChipGroup.Control` | Renders `EtChipsGroupV2` bound to context value/onChange |
| `EtFormChipGroup.ErrorMessage` | Inline error text |

**Usage:**

```tsx
import { EtFormChipGroup, ChipsGroupItem } from 'etoro-ui/form';

const interests: ChipsGroupItem[] = [
  { id: 'stocks', label: 'Stocks', icon: 'barChart' },
  { id: 'crypto', label: 'Crypto', icon: 'btc' },
  { id: 'etf', label: 'ETFs' },
];

<EtFormChipGroup
  name="interests"
  control={control}
  rules={{ validate: v => v?.length > 0 || 'Pick at least one' }}
>
  <EtFormChipGroup.Control
    items={interests}
    layout="wrap"
    haptics={false}
  />
  <EtFormChipGroup.ErrorMessage />
</EtFormChipGroup>
```

**Field value:** `string[]` (array of selected chip IDs)

